    "brand": "Naked Nutrition",
    "badge": "The Product Reviewed",
    "category": "Three-ingredient mass gainer",
    "description": "This is the original Naked Mass. Per the label at the time of writing, about seven scoops (321 g) give 1,250 calories, 50 g of protein from whey protein concentrate and micellar casein, 252 g of carbohydrate from organic tapioca maltodextrin, 21 g of sugars and 2.5 g of fat, with 11 servings per 8 lb bag. There is no sweetener, flavor or creatine, and Naked says it is Contents Certified by NSF. At the $79.99 we saw on Amazon, that is about $3.64 per 25 g of protein.",
