      "No certification mark stated in the listing",
      "Only 8 servings per 6 lb bag"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The pick if price per serving matters more to you than a short ingredient list.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein / serving": "52 g (listing)",
      "Calories": "About 1,280",
      "Third-party testing": "None stated in the listing",
      "Cost per 25 g": "About $2.40 (Amazon price seen)"
    },
    "amazonUrl": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0020XQWCA"
  }
