          <p>
            The serving size is the recurring complaint. Seven scoops of powder in 24 oz of liquid makes a very large, thick drink, and buyers say it expands when blended. Many split it into two or three smaller shakes, and vegan buyers mention confusion over serving-size changes. A blender works better than a shaker bottle for a full serving, although vegan buyers say that version mixes easily in a shaker.
          </p>

          <p>
